Follow all rules in `AGENTS.md` at the repository root before making any change.
If `AGENTS.project.md` exists, read it as well; its rules take priority over `AGENTS.md`,
except for the safety rules in sections 27, 28, 29, and 33 of `AGENTS.md`.

Key reminders:

- Make only the changes explicitly requested, and keep them minimal.
- Search for and reuse existing code before writing new code.
- Present a plan proportional to the task before implementing.
- Do not commit, push, or run destructive commands unless explicitly asked.
- Report verification results accurately; never claim tests passed unless they ran.